# AI Video Generator – Project Overview

## Architecture
This is a full-stack AI video generation application with:
- **Backend**: FastAPI (Python) serving REST/WebSocket APIs
- **Frontend**: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui
- **Video Engines**: MoneyPrinter and Brainrot video generation systems

## Entry Points
- **Backend Main**: [backend/app.py](mdc:backend/app.py) - FastAPI application
- **Frontend Main**: [frontend/src/main.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/main.tsx) - React app entry
- **Frontend App**: [frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/App.tsx) - Main React component

## Key Directories
- `backend/` - Python FastAPI backend
- `frontend/` - React frontend application
- `backend/vendors/moneyprinter/` - MoneyPrinter video generation engine
- `backend/vendors/brainrot/` - Brainrot video generation engine
- `output/` - Generated video files storage
- `logs/` - Application logs

## Development Commands
- **Full stack**: `./start.sh` - Launches both backend (8080) and frontend (5173)
- **Backend only**: `uvicorn app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --reload` in `backend/`
- **Frontend only**: `npm run dev` in `frontend/`
- **Tests**: `pytest` in `backend/`

## Environment Variables
- `VIDEOHELPER_OUTPUT_DIR` - Output directory (defaults to `output/`)
- `API_KEY` - Optional API key for endpoint protection
- `PEXELS_API_KEY` - Required for MoneyPrinter video search
- `GOOGLE_API_KEY`/`GEMINI_API_KEY` - Required for AI text generation
- `CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS` - CORS configuration
- `RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE` - Rate limiting per IP